<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean oil major sales activity in the week ended Oct 10 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p> Net Sales:   1996/97		    1997/98</p>
<p> Unknown	 3,500			  Nil</p>
<p> Nicaragua     2,500</p>
<p> Colombia	2,000</p>
<p> Mexico	  2,000</p>
<p>Major export destinations included Mexico (2,300), Jamaica (100) and Canada (100).</p>
